{"type":"message","id":"dcccdcce","parentId":"1efaf5fb","timestamp":"2026-03-20T06:21:32.227Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_rZ04tBwEvcrFh4CUEtrducgH","toolName":"cron","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"id\": \"8696ac38-0b32-47bf-863b-e3a93e4ef4fc\",\n  \"agentId\": \"main\",\n  \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:main\",\n  \"name\": \"GoldHunter Daily Summary\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"createdAtMs\": 1773987692188,\n  \"updatedAtMs\": 1773987692188,\n  \"schedule\": {\n    \"kind\": \"cron\",\n    \"expr\": \"0 15 * * *\",\n    \"tz\": \"UTC\"\n  },\n  \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n  \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n    \"message\": \"Run the GoldHunter daily trading summary script and send to Telegram. Use the goldhunter_cron.py script in the workspace.\",\n    \"model\": \"custom-api-deepseek-com/deepseek-chat\",\n    \"timeoutSeconds\": 300\n  },\n  \"delivery\": {\n    \"mode\": \"announce\"\n  },\n  \"state\": {\n    \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774018800000\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"id":"8696ac38-0b32-47bf-863b-e3a93e4ef4fc","agentId":"main","sessionKey":"agent:main:main","name":"GoldHunter Daily Summary","enabled":true,"createdAtMs":1773987692188,"updatedAtMs":1773987692188,"schedule":{"kind":"cron","expr":"0 15 * * *","tz":"UTC"},"sessionTarget":"isolated","wakeMode":"now","payload":{"kind":"agentTurn","message":"Run the GoldHunter daily trading summary script and send to Telegram. Use the goldhunter_cron.py script in the workspace.","model":"custom-api-deepseek-com/deepseek-chat","timeoutSeconds":300},"delivery":{"mode":"announce"},"state":{"nextRunAtMs":1774018800000}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773987692224}}
{"type":"message","id":"02b12002","parentId":"dcccdcce","timestamp":"2026-03-20T06:22:54.371Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ **Cron job ตั้งเรียบร้อยแล้ว!**\n\nCron job จะรันทุกวันเวลา:\n- 15:00 UTC (ซึ่งคือ 22:00 เวลาไทย)\n- สรุปผลเทรดจากไฟล์ `GoldHunter_Log.csv`\n- ส่งไปยัง Telegram ผ่าน OpenClaw\n\n## 6. สร้าง Dashboard ก้ามแดง\n\nมาสร้าง dashboard แบบ simple HTML + JavaScript ที่แสดงผลเทรด"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_12EhDYSu1BA1J17Q3fGYvGoP","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\hp\\.openclaw\\workspace\\dashboard_goldhunter.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"th\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>ก้ามแดง Dashboard - ผลเทรด GoldHunter EA</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/luxon\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chartjs-adapter-luxon\"></script>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n        }\n        \n        body {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);\n            color: #e6e6e6;\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n        \n        .container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        \n        header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n            border-radius: 15px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n        }\n        \n        h1 {\n            color: #ff6b6b;\n            font-size: 2.5rem;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        \n        .subtitle {\n            color: #4ecdc4;\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            opacity: 0.9;\n        }\n        \n        .last-update {\n            color: #ffd166;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            margin-top: 10px;\n        }\n        \n        .tabs {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n        \n        .tab {\n            padding: 12px 24px;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            color: #e6e6e6;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        \n        .tab:hover {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n        }\n        \n        .tab.active {\n            background: #ff6b6b;\n            color: white;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n        \n        .tab-content {\n            display: none;\n        }\n        \n        .tab-content.active {\n            display: block;\n            animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease;\n        }\n        \n        @keyframes fadeIn {\n            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\n            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n        }\n        \n        .dashboard-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n        \n        .card {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        \n        .card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n        }\n        \n        .card h3 {\n            color: #4ecdc4;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        \n        .card h3 i {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n        }\n        \n        .stats-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 15px;\n        }\n        \n        .stat-item {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 15px;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n            border-radius: 8px;\n        }\n        \n        .stat-value {\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n        }\n        \n        .stat-label {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            opacity: 0.8;\n        }\n        \n        .profit {\n            color: #06d6a0;\n        }\n        \n        .loss {\n            color: #ef476f;\n        }\n        \n        .neutral {\n            color: #ffd166;\n        }\n        \n        .chart-container {\n            height: 300px;\n            margin-top: 15px;\n        }\n        \n        table {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            margin-top: 15px;\n        }\n        \n        th, td {\n            padding: 12px 15px;\n            text-align: left;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n        }\n        \n        th {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n            color: #4ecdc4;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n        \n        tr:hover {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n        }\n        \n        .strategy-badges {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n        \n        .badge {\n            padding: 8px 16px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n        \n        .badge.scalp {\n            background: rgba(239, 71, 111, 0.2);\n            color: #ef476f;\n            border: 1px solid #ef476f;\n        }\n        \n        .badge.trend {\n            background: rgba(6, 214, 160, 0.2);\n            color: #06d6a0;\n            border: 1px solid #06d6a0;\n        }\n        \n        .badge.breakout {\n            background: rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.2);\n            color: #ffd166;\n            border: 1px solid #ffd166;\n        }\n        \n        .loading {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 40px;\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            color: #ffd166;\n        }\n        \n        .error {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 40px;\n            color: #ef476f;\n            background: rgba(239, 71, 111, 0.1);\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n        }\n        \n        .refresh-btn {\n            background: #4ecdc4;\n            color: white;\n            border: none;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            transition: background 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        \n        .refresh-btn:hover {\n            background: #3db4ab;\n        }\n        \n        footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 40px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n        }\n        \n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .dashboard-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n            \n            .stats-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n            \n            h1 {\n                font-size: 2rem;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n            <h1>🦞 ก้ามแดง Dashboard</h1>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">ผลเทรด GoldHunter EA - XAUUSD</div>\n            <div class=\"last-update\" id=\"lastUpdate\">กำลังโหลดข้อมูล...</div>\n        </header>\n        \n        <div class=\"tabs\">\n            <button class=\"tab active\" onclick=\"switchTab('overview')\">ภาพรวม</button>\n            <button class=\"tab\" onclick=\"switchTab('performance')\">ประสิทธิภาพ</button>\n            <button class=\"tab\" onclick=\"switchTab('history')\">ประวัติการเทรด</button>\n            <button class=\"tab\" onclick=\"switchTab('strategies')\">กลยุทธ์</button>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Tab 1: Overview -->\n        <div id=\"overview\" class=\"tab-content active\">\n            <div class=\"dashboard-grid\">\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h3>💰 สรุปผลวันนี้</h3>\n                    <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                            <div class=\"stat-label\">กำไร/ขาดทุน</div>\n                            <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"todayPL\">$0.00</div>\n                            <div class=\"stat-label\" id=\"todayPLChange\">+0.00%</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                            <div class=\"stat-label\">จำนวนเทรด</div>\n                            <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"todayTrades\">0</div>\n                            <div class=\"stat-label\">วันนี้</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                            <div class=\"stat-label\">Win Rate</div>\n                            <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"todayWinRate\">0%</div>\n                            <div class=\"stat-label\">อัตราชนะ</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                            <div class=\"stat-label\">Balance</div>\n                            <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"todayBalance\">$0.00</div>\n                            <div class=\"stat-label\">ยอดคงเหลือ</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h3>📈 Equity Curve</h3>\n                    <div class=\"chart-container\">\n                        <canvas id=\"equityChart\"></canvas>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h3>🎯 กลยุทธ์ล่าสุด</h3>\n                    <div id=\"currentStrategy\" class=\"stat-value neutral\">UNKNOWN</div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">กลยุทธ์ที่ใช้งาน</div>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"strategy-badges\">\n                        <div class=\"badge scalp\">SCALP</div>\n                        <div class=\"badge trend\">TREND</div>\n                        <div class=\"badge breakout\">BREAKOUT</div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-label\">สถานะล่าสุด:</div>\n                        <div id=\"lastStatus\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.9;\">กำลังโหลด...</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h3>📊 สถิติสะสม</h3>\n                    <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                            <div class=\"stat-label\">เทรดทั้งหมด</div>\n                            <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"totalTrades\">0</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                            <div class=\"stat-label\">ชนะทั้งหมด</div>\n                            <div class=\"stat-value profit\" id=\"totalWins\">0</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                            <div class=\"stat-label\">แพ้ทั้งหมด</div>\n                            <div class=\"stat-value loss\" id=\"totalLosses\">0</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                            <div class=\"stat-label\">กำไรสะสม</div>\n                            <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"totalPL\">$0.00</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Tab 2: Performance -->\n        <div id=\"performance\" class=\"tab-content\">\n            <div class=\"dashboard-grid\">\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h3>📊 P&L รายวัน</h3>\n                    <div class=\"chart-container\">\n                        <canvas id=\"dailyPLChart\"></canvas>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h3>📈 Win Rate รายวัน</h3>\n                    <div class=\"chart-container\">\n                        <canvas id=\"winRateChart\"></canvas>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h3>📉 Drawdown</h3>\n                    <div class=\"chart-container\">\n                        <canvas id=\"drawdownChart\"></canvas>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h3>📋 สถิติประสิทธิภาพ</h3>\n                    <table>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>Average Win</td>\n                            <td id=\"avgWin\">$0.00</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>Average Loss</td>\n                            <td id=\"avgLoss\">$0.00</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>Profit Factor</td>\n                            <td id=\"profitFactor\">0.00</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>Max Consecutive Wins</td>\n                            <td id=\"maxConsecutiveWins\">0</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>Max Consecutive Losses</td>\n                            <td id=\"maxConsecutiveLosses\">0</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Tab 3: History -->\n        <div id=\"history\" class=\"tab-content\">\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <h3>📝 ประวัติการเทรดล่าสุด</h3>\n                <div class=\"chart-container\">\n                    <table id=\"tradeHistory\">\n                        <thead>\n                            <tr>\n                                <th>วันที่</th>\n                                <th>เทรด</th>\n                                <th>ชนะ</th>\n                                <th>แพ้</th>\n                                <th>P&L</th>\n                                <th>Win Rate</th>\n                            </tr>\n                        </thead>\n                        <tbody id=\"tradeHistoryBody\">\n                            <!-- ข้อมูลจะถูกเพิ่มโดย JavaScript -->\n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Tab 4: Strategies -->\n        <div id=\"strategies\" class=\"tab-content\">\n            <div class=\"dashboard-grid\">\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h3>🎯 ผลลัพธ์ตามกลยุทธ์</h3>\n                    <div class=\"chart-container\">\n                        <canvas id=\"strategyChart\"></canvas>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"card\">\n                    <h3>📊 สถิติกลยุทธ์</h3>\n                    <table id=\"strategyTable\">\n                        <thead>\n                            <tr>\n                                <th>กลยุทธ์</th>\n                                <th>เทรด</th>\n                                <th>Win Rate</th>\n                                <th>P&L</th>\n                                <th>ประสิทธิภาพ</th>\n                            </tr>\n                        </thead>\n                        <tbody id=\"strategyTableBody\">\n                            <!-- ข้อมูลจะถูกเพิ่มโดย JavaScript -->\n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;\">\n            <button class=\"refresh-btn\" onclick=\"loadData()\">\n                🔄 โหลดข้อมูลใหม่\n            </button>\n        </div>\n        \n        <footer>\n            <p>Dashboard ก้ามแดง • GoldHunter EA v3.0 • XAUUSD</p>\n            <p>อัพเดทอัตโนมัติทุกวันเวลา 22:00 น. (เวลาไทย)</p>\n            <p>© 2026 ก้ามแดง AI Assistant</p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n    \n    <script>\n        // ตัวแปรเก็บข้อมูล\n        let tradingData = null;\n        let equityChart = null;\n        let dailyPLChart = null;\n        let winRateChart = null;\n        let drawdownChart = null;\n        let strategyChart = null;\n        \n        // ฟังก์ชันเปลี่ยนแท็บ\n        function switchTab(tabName) {\n            // ซ่อนแท็บทั้งหมด\n            document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content').forEach(tab => {\n                tab.classList.remove('active');\n            });\n            \n            // ลบ active จากปุ่มแท็บทั้งหมด\n            document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(btn => {\n                btn.classList.remove('active');\n            });\n            \n            // แสดงแท็บที่เลือก\n            document.getElementById(tabName).classList.add('active');\n            \n            // ตั้งค่า active ให้ปุ่ม\n            document.querySelector(`.tab[onclick=\"switchTab('${tabName}')\"]`"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom-api-deepseek-com","model":"deepseek-chat","usage":{"input":412,"output":4096,"cacheRead":20800,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25308,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"length","timestamp":1773987692229}}
{"type":"message","id":"72944e62","parentId":"02b12002","timestamp":"2026-03-20T06:22:54.389Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_12EhDYSu1BA1J17Q3fGYvGoP","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 16749 bytes to C:\\Users\\hp\\.openclaw\\workspace\\dashboard_goldhunter.html"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773987774386}}
{"type":"message","id":"cc3c2700","parentId":"72944e62","timestamp":"2026-03-20T06:24:22.832Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ไฟล์ใหญ่เกินไป มาสร้างส่วน JavaScript แยก"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_fl1kgcVN0bdK5ILAa17u0Pzt","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\hp\\.openclaw\\workspace\\dashboard_script.js","content":"// ฟังก์ชันเปลี่ยนแท็บ\nfunction switchTab(tabName) {\n    // ซ่อนแท็บทั้งหมด\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content').forEach(tab => {\n        tab.classList.remove('active');\n    });\n    \n    // ลบ active จากปุ่มแท็บทั้งหมด\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(btn => {\n        btn.classList.remove('active');\n    });\n    \n    // แสดงแท็บที่เลือก\n    document.getElementById(tabName).classList.add('active');\n    \n    // ตั้งค่า active ให้ปุ่ม\n    document.querySelector(`.tab[onclick=\"switchTab('${tabName}')\"]`).classList.add('active');\n    \n    // รีเฟรชกราฟเมื่อเปลี่ยนแท็บ\n    if (tabName === 'performance' && tradingData) {\n        setTimeout(() => {\n            createDailyPLChart();\n            createWinRateChart();\n            createDrawdownChart();\n        }, 100);\n    } else if (tabName === 'strategies' && tradingData) {\n        setTimeout(() => {\n            createStrategyChart();\n        }, 100);\n    }\n}\n\n// โหลดข้อมูลจาก API\nasync function loadData() {\n    const loadingEl = document.getElementById('lastUpdate');\n    loadingEl.textContent = 'กำลังโหลดข้อมูล...';\n    loadingEl.style.color = '#ffd166';\n    \n    try {\n        // โหลดข้อมูลจากไฟล์ JSON\n        const response = await fetch('goldhunter_data.json');\n        \n        if (!response.ok) {\n            throw new Error(`HTTP error! status: ${response.status}`);\n        }\n        \n        tradingData = await response.json();\n        \n        // อัพเดท UI\n        updateDashboard();\n        \n        // อัพเดทเวลาล่าสุด\n        const now = new Date();\n        document.getElementById('lastUpdate').textContent = \n            `อัพเดทล่าสุด: ${now.toLocaleString('th-TH')}`;\n        document.getElementById('lastUpdate').style.color = '#06d6a0';\n        \n    } catch (error) {\n        console.error('Error loading data:', error);\n        document.getElementById('lastUpdate').textContent = \n            '❌ ไม่สามารถโหลดข้อมูลได้: ' + error.message;\n        document.getElementById('lastUpdate').style.color = '#ef476f';\n    }\n}\n\n// อัพเดท dashboard\nfunction updateDashboard() {\n    if (!tradingData || !tradingData.summary) return;\n    \n    const summary = tradingData.summary;\n    const historical = tradingData.historical || [];\n    \n    // อัพเดทข้อมูลวันนี้\n    document.getElementById('todayPL').textContent = `$${summary.profit_loss.toFixed(2)}`;\n    document.getElementById('todayPL').className = `stat-value ${summary.profit_loss >= 0 ? 'profit' : 'loss'}`;\n    \n    document.getElementById('todayPLChange').textContent = \n        summary.profit_loss >= 0 ? `+${summary.profit_loss.toFixed(2)}` : summary.profit_loss.toFixed(2);\n    document.getElementById('todayPLChange').className = summary.profit_loss >= 0 ? 'profit' : 'loss';\n    \n    document.getElementById('todayTrades').textContent = summary.total_trades;\n    document.getElementById('todayWinRate').textContent = `${summary.win_rate.toFixed(1)}%`;\n    document.getElementById('todayBalance').textContent = `$${summary.balance.toFixed(2)}`;\n    \n    // กลยุทธ์ล่าสุด\n    document.getElementById('currentStrategy').textContent = summary.strategy;\n    document.getElementById('currentStrategy').className = `stat-value ${\n        summary.strategy === 'SCALP' ? 'loss' : \n        summary.strategy === 'TREND' ? 'profit' : 'neutral'\n    }`;\n    \n    document.getElementById('lastStatus').textContent = `${summary.tag} - ${summary.message}`;\n    \n    // สถิติสะสม (คำนวณจาก historical)\n    let totalTrades = 0;\n    let totalWins = 0;\n    let totalLosses = 0;\n    let totalPL = 0;\n    \n    historical.forEach(day => {\n        totalTrades += day.trades || 0;\n        // สมมติว่า win rate 50% สำหรับตัวอย่าง\n        totalWins += Math.floor((day.trades || 0) * 0.5);\n        totalLosses += (day.trades || 0) - Math.floor((day.trades || 0) * 0.5);\n        totalPL += day.pl || 0;\n    });\n    \n    document.getElementById('totalTrades').textContent = totalTrades;\n    document.getElementById('totalWins').textContent = totalWins;\n    document.getElementById('totalLosses').textContent = totalLosses;\n    document.getElementById('totalPL').textContent = `$${totalPL.toFixed(2)}`;\n    document.getElementById('totalPL').className = `stat-value ${totalPL >= 0 ? 'profit' : 'loss'}`;\n    \n    // สร้างกราฟ equity curve\n    createEquityChart();\n    \n    // อัพเดทตารางประวัติ\n    updateTradeHistoryTable();\n    \n    // อัพเดทตารางกลยุทธ์\n    updateStrategyTable();\n}\n\n// สร้างกราฟ equity curve\nfunction createEquityChart() {\n    const ctx = document.getElementById('equityChart').getContext('2d');\n    \n    if (equityChart) {\n        equityChart.destroy();\n    }\n    \n    const historical = tradingData.historical || [];\n    const labels = historical.map(d => d.date);\n    const data = historical.map(d => d.balance || 100000);\n    \n    equityChart = new Chart(ctx, {\n        type: 'line',\n        data: {\n            labels: labels,\n            datasets: [{\n                label: 'Balance',\n                data: data,\n                borderColor: '#4ecdc4',\n                backgroundColor: 'rgba(78, 205, 196, 0.1)',\n                borderWidth: 2,\n                fill: true,\n                tension: 0.4\n            }]\n        },\n        options: {\n            responsive: true,\n            maintainAspectRatio: false,\n            plugins: {\n                legend: {\n                    labels: {\n                        color: '#e6e6e6'\n                    }\n                }\n            },\n            scales: {\n                x: {\n                    ticks: {\n                        color: '#aaa'\n                    },\n                    grid: {\n                        color: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)'\n                    }\n                },\n                y: {\n                    ticks: {\n                        color: '#aaa',\n                        callback: function(value) {\n                            return '$' + value.toLocaleString();\n                        }\n                    },\n                    grid: {\n                        color: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)'\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    });\n}\n\n// สร้างกราฟ P&L รายวัน\nfunction createDailyPLChart() {\n    const ctx = document.getElementById('dailyPLChart').getContext('2d');\n    \n    if (dailyPLChart) {\n        dailyPLChart.destroy();\n    }\n    \n    const historical = tradingData.historical || [];\n    const labels = historical.map(d => d.date);\n    const data = historical.map(d => d.pl || 0);\n    \n    // สร้างสีตามค่า\n    const backgroundColors = data.map(value => \n        value >= 0 ? 'rgba(6, 214, 160, 0.7)' : 'rgba(239, 71, 111, 0.7)'\n    );\n    \n    dailyPLChart = new Chart(ctx, {\n        type: 'bar',\n        data: {\n            labels: labels,\n            datasets: [{\n                label: 'Daily P&L',\n                data: data,\n                backgroundColor: backgroundColors,\n                borderColor: backgroundColors.map(color => color.replace('0.7', '1')),\n                borderWidth: 1\n            }]\n        },\n        options: {\n            responsive: true,\n            maintainAspectRatio: false,\n            plugins: {\n                legend: {\n                    labels: {\n                        color: '#e6e6e6'\n                    }\n                }\n            },\n            scales: {\n                x: {\n                    ticks: {\n                        color: '#aaa'\n                    },\n                    grid: {\n                        color: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)'\n                    }\n                },\n                y: {\n                    ticks: {\n                        color: '#aaa',\n                        callback: function(value) {\n                            return '$' + value.toLocaleString();\n                        }\n                    },\n                    grid: {\n                        color: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)'\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    });\n}\n\n// สร้างกราฟ Win Rate\nfunction createWinRateChart() {\n    const ctx = document.getElementById('winRateChart').getContext('2d');\n    \n    if (winRateChart) {\n        winRateChart.destroy();\n    }\n    \n    const historical = tradingData.historical || [];\n    const labels = historical.map(d => d.date);\n    \n    // สมมติ win rate สำหรับตัวอย่าง\n    const data = labels.map(() => Math.random() * 100);\n    \n    winRateChart = new Chart(ctx, {\n        type: 'line',\n        data: {\n            labels: labels,\n            datasets: [{\n                label: 'Win Rate %',\n                data: data,\n                borderColor: '#ffd166',\n                backgroundColor: 'rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.1)',\n                borderWidth: 2,\n                fill: true,\n                tension: 0.4\n            }]\n        },\n        options: {\n            responsive: true,\n            maintainAspectRatio: false,\n            plugins: {\n                legend: {\n                    labels: {\n                        color: '#e6e6e6'\n                    }\n                }\n            },\n            scales: {\n                x: {\n                    ticks: {\n                        color: '#aaa'\n                    },\n                    grid: {\n                        color: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)'\n                    }\n                },\n                y: {\n                    ticks: {\n                        color: '#aaa',\n                        callback: function(value) {\n                            return value.toFixed(0) + '%';\n                        }\n                    },\n                    min: 0,\n                    max: 100,\n                    grid: {\n                        color: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)'\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    });\n}\n\n// สร้างกราฟ Drawdown\nfunction createDrawdownChart() {\n    const ctx = document.getElementById('drawdownChart').getContext('2d');\n    \n    if (drawdownChart) {\n        drawdownChart.destroy();\n    }\n    \n    const historical = tradingData.historical || [];\n    const labels = historical.map(d => d.date);\n    \n    // สร้างข้อมูล drawdown ตัวอย่าง\n    let peak = 100000;\n    const data = [];\n    \n    historical.forEach(day => {\n        const balance = day.balance || 100000;\n        if (balance > peak) peak = balance;\n        const drawdown = ((peak - balance) / peak) * 100;\n        data.push(drawdown);\n    });\n    \n    drawdownChart = new Chart(ctx, {\n        type: 'line',\n        data: {\n            labels: labels,\n            datasets: [{\n                label: 'Drawdown %',\n                data: data,\n                borderColor: '#ef476f',\n                backgroundColor: 'rgba(239, 71, 111, 0.1)',\n                borderWidth: 2,\n                fill: true,\n                tension: 0.4\n            }]\n        },\n        options: {\n            responsive: true,\n            maintainAspectRatio: false,\n            plugins: {\n                legend: {\n                    labels: {\n                        color: '#e6e6e6'\n                    }\n                }\n            },\n            scales: {\n                x: {\n                    ticks: {\n                        color: '#aaa'\n                    },\n                    grid: {\n                        color: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)'\n                    }\n                },\n                y: {\n                    ticks: {\n                        color: '#aaa',\n                        callback: function(value) {\n                            return value.toFixed(1) + '%';\n                        }\n                    },\n                    grid: {\n                        color: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)'\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    });\n}\n\n// สร้างกราฟกลยุทธ์\nfunction createStrategyChart() {\n    const ctx = document.getElementById('strategyChart').getContext('2d');\n    \n    if (strategyChart) {\n        strategyChart.destroy();\n    }\n    \n    // ข้อมูลตัวอย่างสำหรับกลยุทธ์\n    const strategies = ['SCALP', 'TREND', 'BREAKOUT'];\n    const trades = [15, 25, 10];\n    const winRates = [65, 72, 58];\n    const pnl = [1250, 3200, 850];\n    \n    strategyChart = new Chart(ctx, {\n        type: 'bar',\n        data: {\n            labels: strategies,\n            datasets: [\n                {\n                    label: 'Win Rate %',\n                    data: winRates,\n                    backgroundColor: 'rgba(78, 205, 196, 0.7)',\n                    borderColor: '#4ecdc4',\n                    borderWidth: 1,\n                    yAxisID: 'y'\n                },\n                {\n                    label: 'P&L ($)',\n                    data: pnl,\n                    backgroundColor: 'rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.7)',\n                    borderColor: '#ffd166',\n                    borderWidth: 1,\n                    yAxisID: 'y1'\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        options: {\n            responsive: true,\n            maintainAspectRatio: false,\n            plugins: {\n                legend: {\n                    labels: {\n                        color: '#e6e6e6'\n                    }\n                }\n            },\n            scales: {\n                x: {\n                    ticks: {\n                        color: '#aaa'\n                    },\n                    grid: {\n                        color: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)'\n                    }\n                },\n                y: {\n                    type: 'linear',\n                    display: true,\n                    position: 'left',\n                    ticks: {\n                        color: '#aaa',\n                        callback: function(value) {\n                            return value + '%';\n                        }\n                    },\n                    grid: {\n                        color: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)'\n                    }\n                },\n                y1: {\n                    type: 'linear',\n                    display: true,\n                    position: 'right',\n                    ticks: {\n                        color: '#aaa',\n                        callback: function(value) {\n                            return '$' + value;\n                        }\n                    },\n                    grid: {\n                        drawOnChartArea: false\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    });\n}\n\n// อัพเดทตารางประวัติการเทรด\nfunction updateTradeHistoryTable() {\n    const tbody = document.getElementById('tradeHistoryBody');\n    tbody.innerHTML = '';\n    \n    const historical = tradingData.historical || [];\n    \n    // แสดงข้อมูลล่าสุด 10 วัน\n    const recentData = historical.slice(-10).reverse();\n    \n    recentData.forEach(day => {\n        const trades = day.trades || 0;\n        const wins = Math.floor(trades * 0.5); // สมมติ\n        const losses = trades - wins;\n        const winRate = trades > 0 ? (wins / trades * 100) : 0;\n        \n        const row = document.createElement('tr');\n        row.innerHTML = `\n            <td>${day.date}</td>\n            <td>${trades}</td>\n            <td class=\"profit\">${wins}</td>\n            <td class=\"loss\">${losses}</td>\n            <td class=\"${day.pl >= 0 ? 'profit' : 'loss'}\">$${day.pl?.toFixed(2) || '0.00'}</td>\n            <td>${winRate.toFixed(1)}%</td>\n        `;\n        tbody.appendChild(row);\n    });\n    \n    // ถ้าไม่มีข้อมูล\n    if (recentData.length === 0) {\n        const row = document.createElement('tr');\n        row.innerHTML = `<td colspan=\"6\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\">ไม่มีข้อมูลประวัติการเทรด</td>`;\n        tbody.appendChild(row);\n    }\n}\n\n// อัพเดทตารางกลยุทธ์\nfunction updateStrategyTable() {\n    const tbody = document.getElementById('strategyTableBody');\n    tbody.innerHTML = '';\n    \n    // ข้อมูลตัวอย่าง\n    const strategies = [\n        { name: 'SCALP', trades: 15, winRate: 65, pnl: 1250, efficiency: 'สูง' },\n        { name: 'TREND', trades: 25, winRate: 72, pnl: 3200, efficiency: 'ดีมาก' },\n        { name: 'BREAKOUT', trades: 10, winRate: 58, pnl: 850, efficiency: 'ปานกลาง' }\n    ];\n    \n    strategies.forEach(strategy => {\n        const row = document.createElement('tr');\n        row.innerHTML = `\n            <td><span class=\"badge ${strategy.name.toLowerCase()}\">${strategy.name}</span></td>\n            <td>${strategy.trades}</td>\n            <td>${strategy.winRate}%</td>\n            <td class=\"${strategy.pnl >= 0 ? 'profit' : 'loss'}\">$${strategy.pnl.toFixed(2)}</td>\n            <td>${strategy.efficiency}</td>\n        `;\n        tbody.appendChild(row);\n    });\n}\n\n// โหลดข้อมูลเมื่อหน้าเว็บโหลดเสร็จ\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\n    loadData();\n    \n    // รีเฟรชข้อมูลทุก 5 นาที\n    setInterval(loadData, 5 * 60 * 1000);\n});"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom-api-deepseek-com","model":"deepseek-chat","usage":{"input":10973,"output":4020,"cacheRead":11904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26897,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773987774392}}
