{"type":"message","id":"62ee0bc7","parentId":"01936e3c","timestamp":"2026-03-20T07:59:25.469Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01G9eabkidWkFNxSBkQAay9o","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd \"C:\\Users\\hp\\.openclaw\\workspace\\dashboard\" ; claude --permission-mode bypassPermissions --print @\"\nBuild a complete dashboard app running on localhost:3001. \nTech: pure Node.js + Express (no React, no build step), single-page app with vanilla JS.\n\nRequirements:\n1. Express server in server.js, port 3001\n2. Serve one index.html file (in public/)\n3. Beautiful dark-themed dashboard with 4 tabs:\n   - Tab 1: \"ข่าวเศรษฐกิจ\" - Economic news (fetch from https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/news/business/rss.xml via proxy API /api/news, parse XML, show title+link+date, auto-refresh every 5min)\n   - Tab 2: \"รายรับรายจ่าย\" - Income/Expense tracker (add income/expense entries with category+amount+note, store in localStorage, show total balance + list)  \n   - Tab 3: \"หุ้น\" - Stock prices (show AAPL, GOOGL, TSLA, NVDA, mock data ok for now, with colored up/down indicators, chart placeholder)\n   - Tab 4: \"เทรดทอง\" - Gold trading (read from GET /api/gold which reads C:\\Users\\hp\\.openclaw\\workspace\\goldhunter_data.json, show: P&L today, win rate, total trades, balance, equity, last update time, strategy)\n\nAPI routes needed:\n- GET /api/news -> proxy BBC RSS, parse XML, return JSON array of {title, link, pubDate, description}\n- GET /api/gold -> read goldhunter_data.json, return JSON\n\nStyle requirements:\n- Dark background (#0f172a or similar)\n- Accent color: gold/amber (#f59e0b)\n- Clean cards with subtle borders\n- Responsive layout\n- Thai language labels where appropriate\n- Show loading states\n\nAlso create package.json with express dependency.\n\nWhen completely finished, run: openclaw system event --text \"Dashboard 3001 ready!\" --mode now\n\"@","background":true,"workdir":"C:\\Users\\hp\\.openclaw\\workspace\\dashboard"