{"type":"message","id":"8f9b937b","parentId":"ba5e15cc","timestamp":"2026-03-20T08:16:43.593Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"From the screenshots, I can see the user's portfolio data:\n\n**ทองคำ (Gold):**\n- MTS-GOLD: $724.97 (≈ 23,612.27 THB)\n- น้ำหนักคงเหลือ: 0.1537 oz (4.7806 g)\n- ราคาปัจจุบัน: $4,716.85/oz (+1.59%)\n- ต้นทุนต่อ oz: $3,554.81\n- ต้นทุนรวม: $546.37\n\n\n- กำไร: +32.69% (+178.61 USD)\n\n**หุ้นสหรัฐฯ:**\n- มูลค่ารวม: $1,051.60 (≈ 34,250.65 THB)\n- เปลี่ยนแปลง: -0.86%\n- กำไรของสินทรัพย์ที่ถืออยู่: +16.38% (+148.02 USD)\n\nNow looking at the individual stock holdings, starting with RKLB at $192.79 and continuing through the remaining positions.\n\nNext I need to persist this portfolio data, integrate it into the dashboard's stocks section with an option to add custom holdings, and update the finance module accordingly.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"โอเค อ่านรูปได้ครบเลย! มีดังนี้:\n\n**หุ้นสหรัฐฯ 6 ตัว:** RKLB / TSLA / REMX / LLY / NVDA / MSCI  \n**ทองคำ:** MTS-GOLD 0.1537 oz\n\nบันทึกไว้แล้ว แล้วอัพเดท dashboard ให้:\n- หุ้น = พอร์ตจริง + กดเพิ่ม/ลบเองได้\n- รายรับรายจ่าย = แยกรายเดือน"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01Qwtku7zHg3WG1j2hbeC2Pm","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\hp\\.openclaw\\workspace\\dashboard\\public\\index.html","old_string":"// ─── STOCKS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nconst STOCKS = [\n  { ticker:'AAPL', name:'Apple Inc.', price:189.30, change:+1.85, pct:+0.99 },\n  { ticker:'GOOGL', name:'Alphabet Inc.', price:165.50, change:-0.72, pct:-0.43 },\n  { ticker:'TSLA', name:'Tesla Inc.', price:175.40, change:+4.20, pct:+2.45 },\n  { ticker:'NVDA', name:'NVIDIA Corp.', price:875.30, change:+12.50, pct:+1.45 },\n  { ticker:'MSFT', name:'Microsoft Corp.', price:415.80, change:+2.30, pct:+0.56 },\n  { ticker:'AMZN', name:'Amazon.com', price:182.60, change:-1.10, pct:-0.60 },\n  { ticker:'META', name:'Meta Platforms', price:510.20, change:+8.40, pct:+1.67 },\n  { ticker:'BRK.B', name:'Berkshire Hathaway', price:402.10, change:+1.05, pct:+0.26 },\n];\n\nlet stockChart = null;\nfunction loadStocks() {\n  const grid = document.getElementById('stockGrid');\n  grid.innerHTML = STOCKS.map(s => `\n    <div class=\"stock-card\">\n      <div class=\"stock-ticker\">${s.ticker}</div>\n      <div class=\"stock-name\">${s.name}</div>\n      <div class=\"stock-price\">$${s.price.toFixed(2)}</div>\n      <div class=\"stock-change ${s.change >= 0 ? 'up' : 'down'}\">\n        ${s.change >= 0 ? '▲' : '▼'} $${Math.abs(s.change).toFixed(2)} (${s.pct >= 0 ? '+' : ''}${s.pct.toFixed(2)}%)\n      </div>\n    </div>`).join('');\n\n  const ctx = document.getElementById('stockChart').getContext('2d');\n  if (stockChart) stockChart.destroy();\n  stockChart = new Chart(ctx, {\n    type: 'bar',\n    data: {\n      labels: STOCKS.map(s => s.ticker),\n      datasets: [{\n        label: '% Change',\n        data: STOCKS.map(s => s.pct),\n        backgroundColor: STOCKS.map(s => s.pct >= 0 ? 'rgba(6,214,160,.7)' : 'rgba(239,71,111,.7)'),\n        borderColor: STOCKS.map(s => s.pct >= 0 ? '#06d6a0' : '#ef476f'),\n        borderWidth: 1, borderRadius: 5\n      }]\n    },\n    options: {\n      responsive: true, maintainAspectRatio: false,\n      plugins: { legend: { display: false } },\n      scales: {\n        x: { ticks: { color: '#e6e6e6' }, grid: { color: 'rgba(255,255,255,.05)' } },\n        y: { ticks: { color: '#e6e6e6', callback: v => v + '%' }, grid: { color: 'rgba(255,255,255,.08)' } }\n      }\n    }\n  });\n  updateTime();\n}","new_string":"// ─── STOCKS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nconst DEFAULT_PORTFOLIO = [\n  // หุ้นสหรัฐฯ\n  { ticker:'RKLB', name:'Rocket Lab USA', value:192.79, pct:+58.82, profit:+71.40, portPct:18.33, currency:'USD' },\n  { ticker:'TSLA', name:'Tesla Inc.', value:177.80, pct:+3.50, profit:+6.02, portPct:16.91, currency:'USD' },\n  { ticker:'REMX', name:'VanEck Rare Earth ETF', value:175.38, pct:+16.33, profit:+24.62, portPct:16.68, currency:'USD' },\n  { ticker:'LLY', name:'Eli Lilly & Co.', value:169.79, pct:+15.61, profit:+22.92, portPct:16.15, currency:'USD' },\n  { ticker:'NVDA', name:'NVIDIA Corp.', value:168.85, pct:+14.05, profit:+20.80, portPct:16.06, currency:'USD' },\n  { ticker:'MSCI', name:'MSCI Inc.', value:166.99, pct:+1.37, profit:+2.25, portPct:15.88, currency:'USD' },\n  // ทองคำ\n  { ticker:'MTS-GOLD', name:'ทองคำ (0.1537 oz)', value:724.97, pct:+32.69, profit:+178.61, portPct:100, currency:'USD', note:'ต้นทุน $546.37 | $3,554.81/oz | ราคาปัจจุบัน $4,716.85/oz' },\n];\n\nlet portfolio = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('kamdaeng_portfolio') || 'null') || JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(DEFAULT_PORTFOLIO));\nlet stockChart = null;\n\nfunction savePortfolio() { localStorage.setItem('kamdaeng_portfolio', JSON.stringify(portfolio)); }\n\nfunction addStock() {\n  const ticker = document.getElementById('sTicker').value.trim().toUpperCase();\n  const name = document.getElementById('sName').value.trim();\n  const value = parseFloat(document.getElementById('sValue').value);\n  const pct = parseFloat(document.getElementById('sPct').value);\n  const profit = parseFloat(document.getElementById('sProfit').value) || 0;\n  if (!ticker || !value) { alert('ใส่ Ticker และมูลค่าอย่างน้อย'); return; }\n  portfolio.push({ ticker, name: name||ticker, value, pct: pct||0, profit, portPct:0, currency:'USD' });\n  savePortfolio(); loadStocks();\n  ['sTicker','sName','sValue','sPct','sProfit'].forEach(id => document.getElementById(id).value = '');\n}\n\nfunction removeStock(idx) {\n  portfolio.splice(idx, 1);\n  savePortfolio(); loadStocks();\n}\n\nfunction resetPortfolio() {\n  if (confirm('รีเซตกลับเป็น portfolio ตั้งต้น?')) {\n    portfolio = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(DEFAULT_PORTFOLIO));\n    savePortfolio(); loadStocks();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction loadStocks() {\n  const totalValue = portfolio.reduce((s,p) => s + p.value, 0);\n  const totalProfit = portfolio.reduce((s,p) => s + (p.profit||0), 0);\n  const totalPct = totalValue > 0 ? (totalProfit / (totalValue - totalProfit) * 100) : 0;\n\n  document.getElementById('stockSummary').innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"balance-bar\">\n      <div class=\"balance-card income-card\">\n        <div class=\"label\">มูลค่ารวม</div>\n        <div class=\"amount profit\">$${totalValue.toLocaleString('en-US',{minimumFractionDigits:2})}</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:.75rem;opacity:.6;margin-top:4px\">≈ ฿${(totalValue*32.57).toLocaleString('th-TH',{maximumFractionDigits:0})}</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"balance-card net-card\">\n        <div class=\"label\">กำไร/ขาดทุนรวม</div>\n        <div class=\"amount ${totalProfit>=0?'profit':'loss'}\">${totalProfit>=0?'+':''}$${totalProfit.toFixed(2)}</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:.75rem;opacity:.6;margin-top:4px\">${totalPct>=0?'+':''}${totalPct.toFixed(2)}%</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"balance-card\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15)\">\n        <div class=\"label\">จำนวนสินทรัพย์</div>\n        <div class=\"amount neutral\">${portfolio.length}</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:.75rem;opacity:.6;margin-top:4px\">รายการ</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>`;\n\n  const grid = document.getElementById('stockGrid');\n  grid.innerHTML = portfolio.map((s,i) => `\n    <div class=\"stock-card\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"stock-ticker\">${s.ticker}</div>\n          <div class=\"stock-name\">${s.name}</div>\n        </div>\n        <button onclick=\"removeStock(${i})\" style=\"background:none;border:none;color:rgba(239,71,111,.5);cursor:pointer;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1\" title=\"ลบ\">✕</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stock-price\">$${s.value.toFixed(2)}</div>\n      <div class=\"stock-change ${s.pct >= 0 ? 'up' : 'down'}\">\n        ${s.pct >= 0 ? '▲' : '▼'} ${s.pct >= 0?'+':''}${s.pct.toFixed(2)}%\n        ${s.profit ? `<span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem\">(${s.profit>=0?'+':''}$${s.profit.toFixed(2)})</span>` : ''}\n      </div>\n      ${s.note ? `<div style=\"font-size:.72rem;opacity:.5;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.4\">${s.note}</div>` : ''}\n    </div>`).join('');\n\n  // Bar chart กำไร %\n  const ctx = document.getElementById('stockChart').getContext('2d');\n  if (stockChart) stockChart.destroy();\n  stockChart = new Chart(ctx, {\n    type: 'bar',\n    data: {\n      labels: portfolio.map(s => s.ticker),\n      datasets: [{\n        label: '% กำไร/ขาดทุน',\n        data: portfolio.map(s => s.pct),\n        backgroundColor: portfolio.map(s => s.pct >= 0 ? 'rgba(6,214,160,.7)' : 'rgba(239,71,111,.7)'),\n        borderColor: portfolio.map(s => s.pct >= 0 ? '#06d6a0' : '#ef476f'),\n        borderWidth: 1, borderRadius: 5\n      }]\n    },\n    options: {\n      responsive: true, maintainAspectRatio: false,\n      plugins: { legend: { display: false } },\n      scales: {\n        x: { ticks: { color: '#e6e6e6' }, grid: { color: 'rgba(255,255,255,.05)' } },\n        y: { ticks: { color: '#e6e6e6', callback: v => v + '%' }, grid: { color: 'rgba(255,255,255,.08)' } }\n      }\n    }\n  });\n  updateTime();\n}"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","usage":{"input":3,"output":3879,"cacheRead":78469,"cacheWrite":4205,"totalTokens":86556,"cost":{"input":0.000009,"output":0.058185,"cacheRead":0.023540699999999998,"cacheWrite":0.01576875,"total":0.09750344999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773994545464}}
